Packaged builds include:

- LICENSE, and a copy at resources/licenses/GPL-3.0.txt
- this file, and a copy at resources/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
- the stockfish npm package's Copying.txt, at
  resources/licenses/stockfish-Copying.txt
- the same three files inside the app archive, under dist/licenses/

The packager excludes node_modules, which would otherwise drop the
engine package's own license file. The copies above are how that
license travels with the binary.

